00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.490
Then we will, okay?

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:54.280
She's been laying there for half a-

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:54.940
Oh, okay.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:13.140
Come on, this battle is boring.

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:14.440
