00:02:24.670 --> 00:02:25.630
Just battle!

00:02:30.110 --> 00:02:31.070
Ooh, nice one.

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:49.690
Ooh, did you hear something?

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.330
No, I didn't hear something.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.250
Who said that? I heard something.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:03:05.630
Just battle with-

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:10.220
Nice one!

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:14.940
Cadoc hardly hits. I mean, um, uh,

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:16.720
Cadoc, you gotta

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.260
concentrate a little better.

00:03:19.100 --> 00:03:20.060
Try to hit her.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.340
Isn't she going to use her last attack?

00:03:50.760 --> 00:04:04.800
It's time to-

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:16.830
Back her!

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:55.510
Oh, gosh.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:05:17.620
Watch out! She's using the Mimic attack!

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:19.900
