00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:24.360
No, no, no, don't!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:32.060
I'm a good copycat, aren't ya?

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:37.450
Bite her, Cadoc!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:53.680
