00:06:00.910 --> 00:06:40.170
Oh, I just used Confusion.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:48.660
Oh, I feel dizzy.

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:50.600
Me no dizzy.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.680
I feel dizzy.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:20.320
I feel dizzy.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:29.210
She's so annoying!

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:35.890
I feel dizzy.

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:51.320
Use that Ice Ray on her

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.080
