00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.080
You never will,

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:16.620
Makuta!

00:16:16.800 --> 00:16:19.160
Because I am the strongest

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:21.660
of all

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.600
