00:25:01.060 --> 00:25:26.900
You Chinese Idiot!

00:25:30.560 --> 00:25:31.720
Air from China!

00:25:31.760 --> 00:25:32.740
Chinese food!

00:25:44.340 --> 00:25:46.620
