00:25:51.110 --> 00:25:52.090
Yeah, whatever.

00:25:52.510 --> 00:26:00.260
Hey! Look at this!

00:26:00.460 --> 00:26:00.780
Look!

00:26:02.780 --> 00:26:03.080
Look!

00:26:03.320 --> 00:26:03.920
