00:32:29.090 --> 00:32:53.090
Oh no, that was the real Tigger.

00:32:53.370 --> 00:32:57.150
Happy day.

00:32:57.530 --> 00:33:00.850
Oh no, if they figure out what I'm planning, I'm doomed.

00:33:01.230 --> 00:33:01.990
Happy day.

00:33:02.590 --> 00:33:04.830
Evil Tigger, go get that message.

00:33:05.070 --> 00:33:05.790
Happy day.

00:33:05.950 --> 00:33:08.570
I will obey your commands, master.

00:33:08.950 --> 00:33:09.490
Happy day.

00:33:11.970 --> 00:33:13.490
I'll go get that message.

00:33:13.750 --> 00:33:15.050
Boing, boing, boing.

00:33:15.430 --> 00:33:25.480
