00:37:23.820 --> 00:37:25.580
Draft in the water.

00:37:25.580 --> 00:37:26.320
It's a Saturday.

00:37:26.740 --> 00:37:28.060
Fire in the sky.

00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:32.020
You have to find it at the door.

00:37:36.860 --> 00:37:37.440
Some power.

00:37:37.860 --> 00:37:39.140
It's Gatsarika.

00:37:39.500 --> 00:37:53.810
Attack her.

00:40:07.420 --> 00:40:08.320
Punch buggies.

00:40:11.620 --> 00:40:12.520
And Barry.

00:40:12.680 --> 00:42:01.030
You touch me.

00:42:01.610 --> 00:42:03.870
I'll squeeze her if you touch me.

00:42:04.190 --> 00:42:04.990
Touch him.

00:42:05.030 --> 00:42:11.900
