00:42:12.820 --> 00:42:14.120
I like soap.

00:42:28.590 --> 00:42:29.570
Not do that.

00:42:29.650 --> 00:42:30.210
You're supposed to.

00:42:30.250 --> 00:42:30.890
I put them.

00:43:48.340 --> 00:43:48.940
Defy myself.

00:43:49.240 --> 00:43:53.160
That stupid thing tripped me.

00:45:03.780 --> 00:45:04.540
Piper beam.

00:45:05.000 --> 00:45:07.140
