00:45:07.600 --> 00:47:45.340
You, Makuta.

00:47:45.640 --> 00:47:46.820
Toe hung up first.

00:47:53.210 --> 00:47:53.730
Don't you know?

00:47:57.990 --> 00:48:00.090
Just to destroy you, Makuta.

00:48:03.100 --> 00:48:03.580
Use it first.

00:48:04.100 --> 00:48:09.300
Eeny, meeny, moe.

00:48:09.360 --> 00:48:10.300
Catch a tiger by his toe.

00:48:10.440 --> 00:48:11.320
If you have it, let him go.

00:48:11.420 --> 00:48:12.360
Eeny, meeny, meeny, moe.

00:48:12.440 --> 00:48:14.760
My mother says to you, pick the very best one.

00:48:14.820 --> 00:48:16.460
And you are it.

00:48:21.850 --> 00:48:22.730
Vehicle activated.

00:48:31.500 --> 00:48:32.280
