00:49:19.120 --> 00:49:28.020
If a Voxor can do this to a Batarang, imagine what an Exo-Tele can do.

00:49:28.300 --> 00:49:30.040
Oh, I can't even think of that.

00:49:32.980 --> 00:49:34.260
