00:50:39.640 --> 00:50:40.120
Sure.

00:50:45.260 --> 00:50:45.740
Cool.

00:50:45.960 --> 00:51:12.500
One more time.

00:51:12.820 --> 00:51:18.310
Can I use your mask a minute?

00:51:18.490 --> 00:51:18.850
Sure.

00:51:23.740 --> 00:51:25.020
Mask of strength.

00:51:29.010 --> 00:51:29.090
Here you go.

00:51:29.730 --> 00:51:30.270
Thanks.

00:51:30.490 --> 00:51:32.830
Pick the Voxor now.

00:51:33.170 --> 00:51:33.710
Okay.

00:51:34.130 --> 00:51:34.670
Voxor.

00:51:37.600 --> 00:52:07.810
Too much.

00:52:07.890 --> 00:52:12.740
