00:59:08.760 --> 00:59:09.500
That's your fault.

00:59:11.470 --> 00:59:13.730
Maybe I can take his weak spot out with this cloth.

00:59:13.970 --> 00:59:15.330
Spot out with this cloth.

00:59:17.980 --> 00:59:31.960
I'm going to take a little break.

00:59:32.320 --> 00:59:35.520
Anua, you're boss for a few minutes.

00:59:35.860 --> 01:00:17.620
I'm going to use my mask a couple more times.

01:00:44.040 --> 01:00:45.160
I'm trying to shred.

01:00:50.200 --> 01:00:51.640
He's going to be challenging us.

01:01:01.280 --> 01:01:04.000
