01:01:12.540 --> 01:01:13.200
No.

01:01:13.560 --> 01:01:14.000
Whatever.

01:01:20.020 --> 01:01:20.760
Special seeing.

01:01:20.860 --> 01:01:21.840
That's what I like to call it.

01:01:22.080 --> 01:01:25.560
Special vision.

01:01:25.660 --> 01:01:26.600
Yeah, that's a good word.

01:01:27.520 --> 01:01:29.020
Stop with the chit-chat.

01:01:29.160 --> 01:01:29.740
Let's get moving.

01:01:31.060 --> 01:01:32.340
Hey, I can't put it on.

01:01:32.520 --> 01:01:33.440
It's all messed up.

01:01:33.800 --> 01:01:34.980
My head came off.

01:01:35.280 --> 01:01:41.870
There we go.

01:01:45.780 --> 01:01:46.600
Num-nums.

01:01:46.820 --> 01:02:26.040
Exo-Tel's abilities are formidable.

01:02:26.420 --> 01:02:29.820
But your powers are no match for mine.

01:02:30.120 --> 01:02:43.540
They're smart, huh?

01:02:44.940 --> 01:02:47.280
It renders my elemental abilities.

01:02:47.380 --> 01:02:48.900
So I'm going to have to use it later.

01:02:48.900 --> 01:02:49.020
I'm going to have to use it later.

01:02:52.090 --> 01:02:54.250
Yeah, it renders you obsolete.

01:02:54.690 --> 01:04:07.140
Ready to battle.

01:04:07.300 --> 01:04:07.600
Call.

01:04:07.960 --> 01:04:10.880
To revenge.

01:04:11.020 --> 01:04:12.660
To avenge Lewa.

01:04:13.540 --> 01:04:13.820
Yeah!

01:04:17.080 --> 01:04:18.480
Face me, you idiot.

01:04:22.220 --> 01:04:23.740
You're losing your style.

01:04:24.700 --> 01:04:27.500
