03:04:53.540 --> 03:04:54.320
God would.

03:04:59.240 --> 03:05:07.000
Wait, why doesn't he get zoomed in?

03:05:07.560 --> 03:05:12.620
Blade mode.

03:05:13.160 --> 03:05:15.990
He likes it.

03:05:16.510 --> 03:05:19.230
Just attack Nui Rama on a daily basis.

03:05:20.090 --> 03:05:21.230
Just ignore him.

03:05:21.650 --> 03:05:23.050
Ignore whatever he says.

03:05:24.710 --> 03:05:25.990
Did you hear something?

03:05:26.710 --> 03:05:28.350
I think I heard

03:05:28.350 --> 03:05:30.090
my sword hitting Waka's brain.

03:05:31.290 --> 03:05:32.750
Like there is one.

03:05:32.890 --> 03:05:33.910
Luckily for me,

03:05:34.630 --> 03:05:36.190
Conrad doesn't have a brain.

03:05:37.150 --> 03:05:38.510
Ooh, check this out.

03:05:43.060 --> 03:05:44.260
What's wrong with that?

03:05:44.400 --> 03:05:45.900
Your head's hollow, isn't it?

03:05:49.120 --> 03:05:51.020
Waka's brain is a walnut,

03:05:51.220 --> 03:05:53.540
but Conrad doesn't have one.

03:06:00.210 --> 03:06:01.010
Super jab.

03:06:01.390 --> 03:06:04.490
I can throw him in at people.

03:06:05.170 --> 03:06:05.710
Hey,

03:06:06.470 --> 03:06:07.130
he's a walnut.

03:06:08.530 --> 03:06:10.590
I can throw him at cars and make a hole in the window.

03:06:10.790 --> 03:06:13.900
But don't try that at home, kid.

03:06:15.530 --> 03:06:16.050
Trouble.

03:06:23.200 --> 03:06:34.890
They say, shh.

03:06:39.290 --> 03:06:44.540
Bad peoples.

03:07:35.350 --> 03:07:36.390
Last attack.

03:07:53.160 --> 03:08:00.500
What do I do?

03:09:12.570 --> 03:09:13.550
Go on.

03:09:17.560 --> 03:09:20.980
Turn me into a spring.

03:09:23.960 --> 03:09:24.900
That's all I got to say.

03:09:37.600 --> 03:09:38.460
It's Stacy.

03:09:39.300 --> 03:09:40.280
Okay, thank you.

03:09:42.280 --> 03:09:43.280
Get off me.

03:09:43.300 --> 03:09:44.020
Get off me.

03:09:48.230 --> 03:09:58.520
With the bag.

03:10:48.990 --> 03:10:49.230
Stuff.

03:10:50.630 --> 03:10:51.650
Beams and stuff.

03:10:51.810 --> 03:10:52.910
Stop knocking me.

03:11:27.100 --> 03:11:31.310
My hair.

03:11:34.610 --> 03:11:37.550
Are you supposed to...

03:11:47.630 --> 03:11:48.430
Mata Nui bug.

03:11:55.760 --> 03:11:59.760
Oh, no. Don't let her get...

03:12:06.600 --> 03:12:07.400
Fuzzball.

03:12:38.030 --> 03:12:39.750
But I do have this killer insect.

03:12:45.950 --> 03:12:46.430
Where'd she go?

03:13:03.990 --> 03:13:05.290
That's a cell phone.

03:13:08.700 --> 03:13:11.060
Right here.

03:13:11.200 --> 03:13:36.130
I'm going to get it out.

03:13:36.530 --> 03:13:37.670
By yourself.

03:13:42.730 --> 03:13:47.020
And then devour

03:13:47.660 --> 03:13:48.960
Sparky. He's so pathetic.

03:13:56.840 --> 03:13:57.840
Oh, no.

03:13:59.040 --> 03:14:01.020
You'll never get my weak spot out.

03:14:01.140 --> 03:14:02.560
You're not a challenge.

03:14:14.520 --> 03:14:15.260
Awake yet?

03:14:16.680 --> 03:14:25.560
You don't know anyone

03:14:27.840 --> 03:14:29.220
that does this entire battle.

03:14:33.830 --> 03:14:39.260
What did you say?

03:14:40.380 --> 03:14:41.080
What'd you say?

03:14:41.520 --> 03:14:42.080
What?

03:14:47.820 --> 03:14:50.000
She's got psychic powers. Watch out.

03:15:17.600 --> 03:15:18.480
I didn't...

03:15:20.590 --> 03:15:21.990
No, don't fight.

03:15:39.230 --> 03:15:47.560
You'll have to get the bug spray out.

03:15:50.910 --> 03:15:51.950
But I do have...

03:15:53.190 --> 03:16:25.320
Oh, boy.

03:16:46.920 --> 03:16:48.460
She's got to lose some time.

03:16:56.440 --> 03:16:58.120
She's going to use her final attack.

03:17:00.660 --> 03:17:13.700
It's Nell.

03:17:16.350 --> 03:17:17.250
Stacy's mother.

03:17:17.970 --> 03:17:19.450
And Doctor Senora's wife.

03:17:19.770 --> 03:17:39.980
She's weak.

03:18:38.400 --> 03:18:40.560
Beams. Idiot.

03:18:41.620 --> 03:18:42.320
Electric beams.

03:18:42.640 --> 03:20:06.890
She doesn't make up names or anything.

03:20:07.470 --> 03:20:08.610
Like the Toadoo.

03:20:08.990 --> 03:20:26.280
Let me get you.

03:20:26.560 --> 03:24:08.450
She's got a bunch.

03:25:03.940 --> 03:25:14.360
I want to battle Doctor Senora.

03:26:17.580 --> 03:26:18.020
Is that a powerful attack?

03:26:18.360 --> 03:26:19.200
Oh, no.

03:26:40.210 --> 03:26:44.670
It's a Doctor Senora.

03:26:45.010 --> 03:26:51.170
Why didn't you want to get up earlier?

03:26:51.410 --> 03:26:58.820
You're going to need help.

03:26:59.380 --> 03:27:01.180
This guy is so powerful.

03:27:01.480 --> 03:27:04.510
It's you.

03:27:04.830 --> 03:27:09.430
You get out of here, Carl.

03:27:09.750 --> 03:27:11.630
You've been sleeping all the time.

03:27:11.850 --> 03:27:22.060
But Makoto won't be returning.

03:27:37.720 --> 03:27:41.080
Reveal my true appearance to Doctor Senora.

03:27:41.660 --> 03:27:41.980
Huh.

03:27:42.140 --> 03:27:43.460
Is it a ducky?

03:27:45.910 --> 03:27:46.550
Clank.

03:27:46.550 --> 03:27:48.350
What's that piece of junk?

03:27:48.630 --> 03:27:51.670
It's my body.

03:27:52.830 --> 03:27:54.690
It's more powerful than the one

03:27:54.690 --> 03:27:55.750
you see before you.

03:27:56.450 --> 03:27:58.510
You mean you're more powerful than yourself?

03:27:59.130 --> 03:28:00.890
No, the bigger one, you idiot.

03:28:01.110 --> 03:28:07.320
I can take the body

03:28:07.320 --> 03:28:09.460
of anything my Krana attached to.

03:28:09.600 --> 03:28:11.040
Oh, in fact,

03:28:11.040 --> 03:28:13.380
Doctor Senora, I am the Krana

03:28:14.720 --> 03:28:16.220
you see before you.

03:28:16.320 --> 03:28:17.880
The Wheel of Evil.

03:28:18.020 --> 03:28:23.540
But you are so weak.

03:28:23.640 --> 03:28:26.240
We've destroyed you so many times.

03:28:27.020 --> 03:28:28.440
Why do you keep

03:28:28.680 --> 03:28:30.180
thinking you'll defeat us,

03:28:30.280 --> 03:28:31.480
Doctor Senora?

03:28:32.540 --> 03:28:34.460
To win, I only need

03:28:34.460 --> 03:28:35.460
three factors.

03:28:36.220 --> 03:28:38.560
Chaos, destruction,

03:28:39.100 --> 03:28:39.940
and war.

03:28:40.240 --> 03:28:42.420
I only need one more

03:28:42.420 --> 03:28:43.700
factor.

03:28:43.780 --> 03:28:46.860
I already have two of them.

03:28:47.880 --> 03:28:49.440
Destruction, chaos.

03:28:53.900 --> 03:28:56.040
Now what do you think I might need?

03:28:56.340 --> 03:28:58.280
Huh? Universal War?

03:28:58.700 --> 03:28:59.300
Ha!

03:29:00.800 --> 03:29:01.560
Exactly.

03:29:02.500 --> 03:29:03.260
Hmph.

03:29:04.180 --> 03:29:05.100
You're smarter than that.

03:29:05.160 --> 03:29:07.940
Sometimes your intelligence surprises me,

03:29:08.020 --> 03:29:08.860
Doctor Senora.

03:29:09.100 --> 03:29:12.320
You see before you

03:29:12.320 --> 03:29:13.760
the spirit of destruction.

03:29:14.300 --> 03:29:16.580
I am the spirit of destruction,

03:29:16.900 --> 03:29:17.560
Doctor Senora.

03:29:17.700 --> 03:29:19.800
The reason you cannot destroy me

03:29:19.800 --> 03:29:20.980
is because

03:29:20.980 --> 03:29:23.540
is because

03:29:23.540 --> 03:29:26.040
that I am the spirit of destruction.

03:29:26.800 --> 03:29:28.440
If you destroyed me,

03:29:28.560 --> 03:29:30.700
in fact, you can't destroy me

03:29:30.700 --> 03:29:31.920
because if you destroyed me,

03:29:31.980 --> 03:29:34.200
you couldn't destroy anything else.

03:29:35.980 --> 03:29:37.480
Yeah, but then you'd be

03:29:37.480 --> 03:29:38.180
helpless too.

03:29:38.320 --> 03:29:39.880
But I'd be destroyed.

03:29:41.120 --> 03:29:42.880
Evil could run amok

03:29:42.880 --> 03:29:45.340
and you wouldn't be able to stop us.

03:29:45.920 --> 03:29:47.440
Yes, but you couldn't

03:29:47.440 --> 03:29:48.200
destroy us.

03:29:48.440 --> 03:29:50.200
We could threaten you.

03:29:52.080 --> 03:29:53.200
Dying is

03:29:53.200 --> 03:29:53.780
not

03:29:56.570 --> 03:29:57.250
destruction.

03:29:59.110 --> 03:30:00.970
We could take you

03:30:00.970 --> 03:30:03.830
and destroy all of you.

03:30:03.830 --> 03:30:05.870
We couldn't destroy your villages

03:30:05.870 --> 03:30:07.590
or anything like that.

03:30:08.150 --> 03:30:09.510
Shut up. Let's battle.

03:30:09.870 --> 03:30:12.230
No, no. I'm not battling right now.

03:30:12.990 --> 03:30:14.170
Let's let my

03:30:14.170 --> 03:30:16.230
little friends take care of it

03:30:16.230 --> 03:30:16.650
first.

03:30:19.910 --> 03:30:21.890
Get up. Get up. You're up first.

03:30:22.190 --> 03:30:24.710
Dream low.

03:30:24.990 --> 03:30:26.530
But that's what you think.

03:30:26.770 --> 03:30:29.470
I did special training and I am a

03:30:29.470 --> 03:30:30.850
Super Saiyan 4.

03:30:31.230 --> 03:30:42.010
Let's battle.

03:30:42.310 --> 03:30:51.200
I'm not gonna show any mercy on you.

03:30:51.520 --> 03:30:57.860
It doesn't affect me.

03:31:25.500 --> 03:32:51.430
You cannot destroy me.

03:33:08.140 --> 03:33:09.160
A cursed mass.

03:33:16.920 --> 03:33:18.280
Nui Jougi, go.

03:33:18.580 --> 03:34:20.220
You shouldn't be letting these

03:34:20.900 --> 03:34:22.720
so-called servants

03:34:22.720 --> 03:34:25.060
battle for you.

03:34:26.040 --> 03:34:27.020
They are

03:34:27.020 --> 03:34:41.810
so worn out because you

03:34:41.810 --> 03:34:42.590
made them work.

03:34:43.830 --> 03:34:45.190
Go, Mwaka.

03:35:08.020 --> 03:35:12.300
Conra. Insignificant

03:35:12.300 --> 03:35:13.080
little

03:35:14.140 --> 03:35:16.060
person into the ground.

03:35:16.540 --> 03:35:17.640
Stay back.

03:35:17.740 --> 03:35:23.200
Music. Music,

03:35:23.280 --> 03:35:23.820
please.

03:40:13.760 --> 03:40:18.560
If you don't destroy me

03:40:18.560 --> 03:40:20.240
this time, which I doubt

03:40:20.240 --> 03:40:32.840
you will escape and cause

03:40:32.840 --> 03:40:35.200
havoc beyond your wildest

03:40:35.200 --> 03:40:38.460
universal war,

03:40:38.780 --> 03:40:40.600
I will prepare it

03:40:40.600 --> 03:40:41.840
in hiding for one

03:40:42.560 --> 03:40:49.320
year. Well,

03:40:49.460 --> 03:40:51.460
Makuta, let's end this.

03:40:56.120 --> 03:41:01.200
I got him. Let me finish him off

03:41:01.200 --> 03:41:02.840
now. Hold him still.

03:41:05.860 --> 03:41:07.060
Snakey, get in there.

03:41:07.560 --> 03:41:09.060
Suck his soul out.

03:41:09.340 --> 03:41:46.780
At least they're not harmless.

03:41:47.060 --> 03:41:48.560
At least they're not harmful now.

03:42:08.420 --> 03:42:08.700
Just...

03:42:09.480 --> 03:42:10.160
fall.

03:42:49.190 --> 03:43:17.490
This is it, Makuta.

03:43:18.530 --> 03:43:20.090
Well, the spirit of

03:43:20.090 --> 03:43:21.830
destruction meets the weakest

03:43:21.830 --> 03:43:24.150
person in the world. Dr. Cinear,

03:43:24.190 --> 03:43:26.290
you are the most dim-witted

03:43:26.290 --> 03:43:27.810
I have met in the cosmos

03:43:27.810 --> 03:43:29.250
in my travels.

03:43:30.470 --> 03:43:31.870
You're going to be traveling

03:43:31.870 --> 03:43:32.310
to

03:43:33.950 --> 03:43:35.930
the great beyond when I'm done

03:43:35.930 --> 03:43:43.810
finished with you. Fighter mode.

03:43:44.110 --> 03:43:45.050
Fighter mode.

03:43:45.130 --> 03:43:46.690
Fighter mode.

03:43:55.420 --> 03:43:56.260
Or walking mode.

03:44:17.510 --> 03:44:18.690
Music, please.

03:44:36.670 --> 03:44:37.470
Destruction.

03:44:48.520 --> 03:46:30.540
You dare face the spirit of

03:46:30.540 --> 03:46:31.020
destruction?

03:46:32.660 --> 03:46:33.640
Don't move.

03:46:37.770 --> 03:46:38.350
Transform.

